# Line endings are part of the content here: the installer copies local-llm/
# byte for byte and verify.cmd reports any difference, and cmd.exe reads batch
# files most reliably with CRLF. Git must therefore never convert them on
# checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says on the machine that clones.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
local-llm/** -text
